+        *   Mute outside terrain: `mute = smoothstep(waveRadius, waveRadius + waveWidth, d)`.
+        *   Apply: `finalColor = mix(finalColor, dot(finalColor, vec3(0.299, 0.587, 0.114)), mute) + waveContrib`.
 
